1. **What was failing and why:** The 2-operand case (`SOURCE DEST`) where `DEST` is an existing directory was not handled. The code only computed "into directory" semantics when there were 3+ operands. With 2 operands and a directory destination, it treated the directory as the file destination and rejected it with "Not a regular file".

